-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §152 (part מה שעון נוכחות): in a reform
-- school the teaching employees clock in and out on a computerised clock,
-- by the Ministry's reporting rules; until it is installed, by hand; and the
-- working day counts from the clocking, not before 7:00 for a principal and
-- a first deputy and 7:45 for the rest, save an earlier start the district
-- manager approves.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `152`

DECLARE `section 152 action` IS ONE OF
    `clock in on entering and out on leaving the school`
    `report attendance by hand`

-- (א)–(ב): on the clock where it is installed, by hand until then.
@ref akn:art_152__para_a akn:art_152__para_b
GIVEN `the clock is installed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 152 action`
DECIDE `recording attendance` `the clock is installed` IS
    IF `the clock is installed`
    THEN PARTY `the teaching employee` MUST `clock in on entering and out on leaving the school`
         LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "section 152(א): attendance on the computerised clock"
    ELSE PARTY `the teaching employee` MUST `report attendance by hand`
         LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "section 152(ב): attendance by hand until the clock is installed"

-- (ג): the working day counts from the clocking, in minutes after
-- midnight, but not before 7:00 (420) for a principal or first deputy and
-- 7:45 (465) for the rest, unless the district manager approved an earlier
-- start.
@ref akn:art_152__para_c
GIVEN `a principal or first deputy` IS A BOOLEAN, `clocked in at` IS A NUMBER, `an earlier start approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the working day counts from` `a principal or first deputy` `clocked in at` `an earlier start approved` IS
    IF `an earlier start approved`
    THEN `clocked in at`
    ELSE max `clocked in at` (IF `a principal or first deputy` THEN 420 ELSE 465)

#ASSERT `the working day counts from` FALSE 450 FALSE EQUALS 465
#ASSERT `the working day counts from` TRUE 430 FALSE EQUALS 430
#ASSERT `the working day counts from` FALSE 450 TRUE EQUALS 450
